Subject: Report the actual successful presentation rectangle

Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4

Publish a thread-safe snapshot only after successful surface Present, using
the same retained viewport as the EFB blit. Native input can bind exact
presented frames and reject stale resize geometry. Discarded/skipped frames
do not advance the sequence. GX-disabled builds expose an empty snapshot.
Queue presentation does not establish physical display scanout.

